TRAVEL POLICY DOCUMENT

Section 1: General
This document outlines the company travel policy.

Section 2: Hotels
Employees traveling domestically may claim hotel expenses up to 100 dollars per night.
Employees traveling internationally may claim hotel expenses up to 150 dollars per night.

Section 3: Flights
All flights must be booked through the company travel portal.
Economy class is standard for domestic flights.
Business class may be approved for international flights over 6 hours.

Section 4: Meals
Meal allowance is 50 dollars per day for domestic travel.
Meal allowance is 75 dollars per day for international travel.
